**Explicit dependency**:

``` python
import pytest

@pytest.fixture(scope='session')
def resource():
    r = [1]
    yield r
    del r[0]

@pytest.fixture(scope='session')
def sess(request, resource):
    yield
    assert resource == [1]

@pytest.fixture(scope='function')
def func(resource):
    yield

def test_sess(sess):
    pass

def test_func(func):
    pass
```

This dependency passes.

